<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Penn National Gaming.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Penn National Gaming.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Penn National Gaming Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates of $0.65 a share and $1.30 a share, respectively.</p>
<p>-- Penn National gained 3/8 to 16-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
